            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.36.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Is 36:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Obu abasi boona aba Misiri, nubwo balimanya nkooku ndi MUKAMA. MUKAMA akagamba ati: Abaisirairi bakeesiga inywe Abanyamisiri ngu mulibasagika baitu mukasisana nk'omwigo ogutaina maani ogw'orubingo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu baakukwatahoga, obacwekera omu ngaro, ozihutaaliza kimu zoona; kandi obu baakwigamiire nabwo wacweka, baasigara bataina bugumizo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikyo MUKAMA Ruhanga arukugambira ati: Ninyija kwimukiriza abantu bakuseesire bakwasire ebitara, baite abantu n'ebisoro byawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensi Misiri erifooka kitongo kandi ihamba, nubwo balimanya nkooku ndi MUKAMA. “Habwokuba okagamba oti: ‘Ekisaaru Kiira eki, kyange, ninyowe nakihangire;’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "habweki, ndi munyanzigwa wawe, kandi ndi munyanzigwa w'ebyambu byawe, ensi ya Misiri, okurugirra Migidooli okuhika Siyene ha mutaano ogw'Esopiya, ninyija kugifoora ihamba kandi kitongo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tihaligaruka kurabamu muntu, kandi tihaligaruka kurabamu kisoro; erimara emyaka amakumi ana etakaikarwamuga kintu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensi Misiri, ndigifoora kitongo hagati y'ensi ezindi ezafookere bitongo; kandi embuga zaayo zirimara emyaka amakumi ana, hagati y'embuga ezaahwerekereziibwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Habwokuba, MUKAMA Ruhanga naagamba ati: Obu halihinguraho emyaka amakumi ana, ndisorooza Abanyamisiri, mbaihe omu mahanga nambere baararangiire; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abanyagwa ndibagarra omunsi Pasiroosi, ensi ey'obuzaarwa bwabo; oku nuho baliikara, obukama bwabo tibulimanywa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buliba bukama oburukukirra kimu okuba bwa hansi ha makama agandi; kandi tibuligaruka kwenyumirizaaho amahanga ebiro n'ebiro; ndibakeehya muno, tibaligaruka kulema amahanga agandi ebiro byona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isirairi, taligaruka kubeesiga ngu balibakoonyera ebiro byona. Ekikorwa Misiri eki yakozire, kiraijukyaga Isirairi nkooku kyabaire kibi kubeesiga. Obu nubwo Isirairi alimanya nkooku ndi MUKAMA Ruhanga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha kiro eky'okubanza eky'okwezi okw'okubanza, MUKAMA akangambira ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wewe mwana w'omuntu, Nebukadeneeza omukama wa Bbabbulooni, azinisize ihe ery'okuseesira Taya; abaserikale be akabeetwekesa ebintu ebirukulemeera muno, boona nukwo kucweka empara n'okunyubuka amabega baitu noobu baatalibaine bata, omukama n'abaserikale, batagire ekibaasaswirwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikyo MUKAMA arukugambira ati: Ensi Misiri, ninyija kugiha Nebbukadeneeza omukama wa Bbabbulooni, atwale ituungo lyayo, aginyage kandi agyaye; egi, niyo eriba mpeera ey'okusasura ihe rye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA Ruhanga naagamba ati: Ninyija kumuha ensi Misiri habw'emirimo ye ei yakozire, habwokuba ihe rye, likaba nirikorra nyowe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Eki obu kiribaho, abantu ba Isirairi ndibafoora b'amaani, kandi iwe Ezekyeri, ndikwikiriza obaze muno, boona bakuhurre, nubwo balimanya nkooku ndi MUKAMA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
